{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/5f31c981b99410eb81e01edbf0cb06b3.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d140c9a326b2f3f1d5468fbc1b4b5c9e.poster.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d140c9a326b2f3f1d5468fbc1b4b5c9e.webm?t=1772765395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Firstborn were immortal beings created to help shepherd and guide the universe. After violating the gods' prohibition on creating new life, they were sealed away and became a mere myth. Lead your party to uncover the truth of what really happened and decide if the Firstborn poses too great of a threat on the world, or if they are your path to immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/c64b034cbea2e1f263e8f7e9563066fd.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/456b17ce8608ff02af11daa2ba2dddce.poster.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/456b17ce8608ff02af11daa2ba2dddce.webm?t=1772765395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Engage in exciting turn-based combat using one of the most accurate implementations of the classic 3.5 SRD. Equip and ride a war-horse, mastering mounted combat, a rarely-seen feature in overhead RPGs. Employ over 300 spells to vanquish your enemies of over 120 classic monsters who respond with intelligent, reactive AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/dbe885537bd6d1b55363f6ec72e15e66.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/99d54081a20a3680c959ff9a733ba912.poster.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/99d54081a20a3680c959ff9a733ba912.webm?t=1772765395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Wander the countryside in search of long-forgotten treasures, but beware, many of them are well-guarded. Be careful not to stray off the beaten path too soon, as you might discover encounters more difficult than what you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/156cbf2fb62c68b0d6b16329cb50992c.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/db27da6fbeedf93157c9bcfc8cdc9401.poster.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/db27da6fbeedf93157c9bcfc8cdc9401.webm?t=1772765395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Explore, fight, and loot your way through randomly-generated dungeons in the game's Endless Dungeon mode where your sole goal is to survive to reach Level 20. Discover a variety of \u201cmini-quests\u201d to keep things interesting as you descend the depths.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3429270?t=1772765395","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3429270?t=1772765395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/fae3beec648c8106c535a06cea7db594d1227b0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772765395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/fae3beec648c8106c535a06cea7db594d1227b0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772765395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/5f31c981b99410eb81e01edbf0cb06b3.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d140c9a326b2f3f1d5468fbc1b4b5c9e.poster.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d140c9a326b2f3f1d5468fbc1b4b5c9e.webm?t=1772765395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Firstborn were immortal beings created to help shepherd and guide the universe. After violating the gods' prohibition on creating new life, they were sealed away and became a mere myth. Lead your party to uncover the truth of what really happened and decide if the Firstborn poses too great of a threat on the world, or if they are your path to immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/c64b034cbea2e1f263e8f7e9563066fd.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/456b17ce8608ff02af11daa2ba2dddce.poster.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/456b17ce8608ff02af11daa2ba2dddce.webm?t=1772765395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Engage in exciting turn-based combat using one of the most accurate implementations of the classic 3.5 SRD. Equip and ride a war-horse, mastering mounted combat, a rarely-seen feature in overhead RPGs. Employ over 300 spells to vanquish your enemies of over 120 classic monsters who respond with intelligent, reactive AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/dbe885537bd6d1b55363f6ec72e15e66.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/99d54081a20a3680c959ff9a733ba912.poster.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/99d54081a20a3680c959ff9a733ba912.webm?t=1772765395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Wander the countryside in search of long-forgotten treasures, but beware, many of them are well-guarded. Be careful not to stray off the beaten path too soon, as you might discover encounters more difficult than what you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/156cbf2fb62c68b0d6b16329cb50992c.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/db27da6fbeedf93157c9bcfc8cdc9401.poster.avif?t=1772765395\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/db27da6fbeedf93157c9bcfc8cdc9401.webm?t=1772765395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Explore, fight, and loot your way through randomly-generated dungeons in the game's Endless Dungeon mode where your sole goal is to survive to reach Level 20. Discover a variety of \u201cmini-quests\u201d to keep things interesting as you descend the depths.</p>","developers":["Sawtooth Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/header.jpg?t=1772765395","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3429270/820934/86e2c9c28e7460d1558c342e5f4e983308615ca0/1750850155/dash_av1.mpd?t=1738295577","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3429270/820934/86e2c9c28e7460d1558c342e5f4e983308615ca0/1750850155/dash_h264.mpd?t=173829